## 1. Source-left test gap
- Strengthened the test to settle with a bounded 64-pass guard until **stack, trigger queue, resolving and pending are all empty**, then assert emptiness and **−4** to each affected opponent from the two Guttersnipe triggers (Bolt + Unsummon casts).
