## 2. Genuine RED — LKI multiplier
- P0 Guttersnipe + P0 Angrath’s Marauders, Bolt then real Unsummon bounce, full settle.
- Expected doubled trigger damage; observed undoubled (each opponent only −4 across two triggers instead of −8).
- Cause: `DamageEachOpponent` called `deal_damage(Some(old_id))`, and `damage_multipliers` skipped sources no longer on battlefield/stack.
- Fix: `deal_damage_from(..., source_controller)` feeds the ability controller’s last-known identity into the existing prevention/replacement pipeline. Normal damage path unchanged; no serialization, replay, allocator or fake-live-object changes.
- Added controls: opponent-controlled Angrath does **not** double P0’s Guttersnipe; living-source doubling covered; eliminated opponent skipped.

